#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:173
msgid ""
"To record production costs for both the finished product and the components "
"in an account other than the default :guilabel:`Variation Account`, set up "
"a :guilabel:`Production` location account (:guilabel:`Production` location "
"type):"
