#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost of Production` (:guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` only, even "
"if using this account is not common for this valuation method): Only if "
"the :ref:`Cost of Production <accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-"
"production>` account was entered during configuration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`עלות ייצור` (:guilabel:`תקופתית (בסגירה)` בלבד, גם אם השימוש "
"בחשבון זה אינו נפוץ עבור שיטת הערכה זו): רק אם חשבון :ref:`עלות ייצור "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>` הוזן במהלך התצורה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stock Variation` displays the difference between the posted "
