#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:159
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:323
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`XLSX` to generate a PDF or XLSX file, "
