msgstr "מחיקת תקציב מותרת רק בשלבים :guilabel:`טיוטה` ו:guilabel:`בוטל`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:90
msgid ""
"To view the budget lines of one or multiple budgets directly from "
