"הדוח במבט :guilabel:`דוח מס`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:161
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon and :guilabel:`Copy to "
