msgid "Module installation"
msgstr "התקנת מודולים"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:40
msgid ""
"Using AvaTax requires :ref:`installing <general/install>` the AvaTax "
"module(s). To do so, open the :guilabel:`Apps` app, remove "
"the :guilabel:`Apps` filter in the :guilabel:`Search` bar, type in `AvaTax`, "
"and press :kbd:`Enter` to display the available modules related to AvaTax:"
msgstr ""
"השימוש ב-AvaTax מחייב את :ref:`התקנת <general/install>` מודול/י AvaTax. לשם "
