#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for SO` (`account_avatax_sale`): Includes the information "
"needed for tax calculation on sales orders in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for SO` (`account_avatax_sale`): כולל את המידע הדרוש "
"לחישוב מס בהזמנות לקוח ב-Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for Inventory` (`account_avatax_stock`): Includes tax "
