msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for Inventory` (`account_avatax_stock`): כולל חישוב מס ב-"
"Odoo מלאי."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:51
msgid ""
"Should AvaTax be needed for geo-localization or with the :doc:`Amazon "
