"../sales/sales/amazon_connector/features>`, :ref:`התקינו <general/install>` "
"מודולים אלה בנפרד:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for geo localization` (`account_avatax_geolocalize`): "
"Includes the features required for integration of AvaTax into geo-"
"localization in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Avatax for geo localization` (`account_avatax_geolocalize`): כולל "
"את התכונות הנדרשות לשילוב AvaTax באיכון גיאוגרפי ב-Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amazon/Avatax Bridge` (`sale_amazon_avatax`): tax calculation "
