msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is an affordable in-app tax calculation service designed "
"for small and medium-sized businesses with essential tax compliance needs. "
"Built on *Avalara's AvaTax* platform, it integrates with Odoo to provide "
"real-time, region-specific tax calculations for sales, purchases, and "
"invoices."
