"דוא\"ל <accounting/bill-digitization/email-alias>` המשויכת ליומן הרכישות, או "
"על ידי :ref:`העלאת PDF <accounting/bill-digitization/manual-upload>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:46
msgid ""
"Once the bill is uploaded, the PDF document appears on the right side of the "
