"לייצור:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:220
msgid ""
"If the status is :guilabel:`Enabled`, the process has been completed "
"successfully."
msgstr "אם המצב הוא :guilabel:`Enabled`, התהליך הושלם בהצלחה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:221
msgid ""
"If the company is not :guilabel:`Enabled`, repeat the process until it is "
"successfully enabled."
msgstr ""
"אם החברה אינה :guilabel:`Enabled`, חזור על התהליך עד שהיא מופעלת בהצלחה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:224
msgid ""
"Watch this `video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_0j9kqL9yOU>`_ for a "
"demonstration of the process."
msgstr ""
"צפה ב`video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_0j9kqL9yOU>`_ להדגמה של התהליך."

