#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:223
msgid ""
"By default, Veri*Factu is in testing mode. The data is sent to test servers "
"and is not considered official. When official data can be sent to the "
"production servers, go to the :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` section in "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` and disable :guilabel:`Test Environment`."
msgstr ""
"כברירת מחדל, Veri*Factu נמצא במצב בדיקה. הנתונים נשלחים לשרתי בדיקה ואינם "
"נחשבים רשמיים. כאשר ניתן לשלוח נתונים רשמיים לשרתי הייצור, עבור אל "
"קטע :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` ב:guilabel:`הגדרות` והשבת את :guilabel:`סביבת "
"בדיקה`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:233
msgid ""
"Once an :doc:`invoice <../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices>` is "
"confirmed, it can be :ref:`sent <accounting/invoice/sending>`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Send` window, the Veri*Factu option is available if "
"Veri*Factu has been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile je :doc:`faktura <../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices>` "
"potvrzena, může být :ref:`odeslána <accounting/invoice/sending>`. V "
"okně :guilabel:`Odeslat` je k dispozici možnost Veri*Factu, pokud byla "
"povolena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:237
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to generate a JSON file containing the invoice "
"details. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all corresponding documents are listed by "
"their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Klikněte na :guilabel:`Odeslat` pro vygenerování souboru JSON obsahujícího "
"podrobnosti faktury. Tento soubor je uložen jako dokument Veri*Factu. Na "
"kartě :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` jsou uvedeny všechny odpovídající dokumenty "
"podle data vytvoření a aktuálního stavu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:242
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:267
msgid ""
"To download a JSON file, click on its document in the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` "
"tab. Then, in the :guilabel:`Open: Veri*Factu Documents` window, click the "
"link in the :guilabel:`JSON` field."
msgstr ""
"Pro stažení souboru JSON klikněte na jeho dokument na "
"kartě :guilabel:`Veri*Factu`. Poté v okně :guilabel:`Open: Veri*Factu "
"Documents` klikněte na odkaz v poli :guilabel:`JSON`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:246
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:271
msgid ""
"The document should be sent to the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)` immediately. However, it may be delayed due to "
"mandatory waiting periods between submissions required by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`. In such cases, the document "
"is automatically sent the next time a scheduled action runs."
msgstr ""
"Dokument by měl být odeslán :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria)` okamžitě. Může však dojít ke zpoždění kvůli povinnému čekacímu "
"období mezi odesláními vyžadovanému :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`. V takových případech je dokument automaticky "
"odeslán při příštím spuštění plánované akce."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:250
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the invoice PDF. Scan this code to "
"verify that the invoice has been received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`."
msgstr ""
"Na PDF faktuře se zobrazí **QR kód** Veri\\*Factu. Naskenujte tento kód pro "
"ověření, že faktura byla přijata a rozpoznána :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal "
"de Administración Tributaria)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:257
msgid "Point of sale orders"
msgstr "Objednávky z pokladny"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:259
msgid ""
"Once an order has been :ref:`paid <pos/use/sell>`, a JSON file containing "
"the order details is generated. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document."
msgstr ""
"לאחר :ref:`תשלום <pos/use/sell>` הזמנה, נוצר קובץ JSON המכיל את פרטי ההזמנה. "
"קובץ זה מאוחסן כמסמך Veri*Factu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:262
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Orders` list view, select the relevant order. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all the corresponding documents are listed "
"by their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Přejděte na :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`. V "
"zobrazení seznamu :guilabel:`Objednávky` vyberte příslušnou objednávku. Na "
"kartě :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` jsou uvedeny všechny odpovídající dokumenty "
"podle data vytvoření a aktuálního stavu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:276
msgid ""
"If an invoice is generated for an order during the payment process, the "
"Veri*Factu document is :ref:`created and sent for the invoice <localizations/"
"spain/veri-factu-invoices>` instead."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je pro objednávku během procesu platby vygenerována faktura, dokument "
"Veri*Factu je :ref:`vytvořen a odeslán pro fakturu <localizations/spain/veri-"
"factu-invoices>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:280
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the order receipt, even if an invoice "
"is created for the order. Scan this code to verify that the invoice has been "
"received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`"
msgstr ""
"Na účtence objednávky se zobrazí **QR kód** Veri\\*Factu, i když je pro "
"objednávku vytvořena faktura. Naskenujte tento kód pro ověření, že faktura "
"byla přijata a rozpoznána :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:287
msgid "TicketBAI"
msgstr "TicketBAI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:289
msgid ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ or "
"**TBAI** is an e-Invoicing system used by the Basque government and its "
"three provincial councils (Álava, Biscay, and Gipuzkoa). Odoo supports the "
"**TicketBAI (TBAI)** electronic invoicing format for all three regions of "
"the **Basque Country**."
msgstr ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ או "
"**TBAI** היא מערכת חשבוניות אלקטרוניות המשמשת את ממשלת בסקיה ושלוש המועצות "
"המחוזיות שלה (אלאווה, ביסקאי וגיפוסקואה). Odoo תומך בפורמט חשבונות "
"אלקטרוניות **TicketBAI (TBAI)** עבור כל שלושת האזורים של **מחוז הבאסקים**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:295
msgid "To use TicketBAI, make sure:"
msgstr "כדי להשתמש ב-TicketBAI, ודא ש:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country` and :guilabel:`Tax ID` fields on the :doc:`company "
"record <../../general/companies>` are filled in."
msgstr ""
"השדות :guilabel:`מדינה` ו:guilabel:`מזהה מס` ב:doc:`רשומת החברה <../../"
"general/companies>` מולאו."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:299
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Spain -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) module is :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"המודול :guilabel:`ספרד -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) :ref:`מותקן <general/"
"install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:301
msgid "To configure TicketBAI, follow these steps:"
msgstr "כדי להגדיר את TicketBAI, בצע את השלבים הבאים:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:303
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"עבור אל :menuselection:`חשבונאות --> תצורה --> הגדרות` וגלול למטה אל "
"קטע :guilabel:`לוקליזציה של ספרד`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:305
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Registro de Libros connection TicketBAI` section, select a "
"region in the :guilabel:`Tax Agency for TBAI` field and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"בקטע :guilabel:`חיבור Registro de Libros TicketBAI`, בחר אזור "
"בשדה :guilabel:`רשות מס עבור TBAI` ו:guilabel:`שמור`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:307
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Manage certificates (TicketBAI)`."
msgstr "לחץ על :guilabel:`נהל אישורים (TicketBAI)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:308
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Certificates for EDI TicketBAI invoices on Spain` view, "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"בתצוגה :guilabel:`אישורים עבור חשבוניות EDI TicketBAI בספרד`, לחץ "
"על :guilabel:`חדש`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:309
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the certificate, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` provided by the tax agency, and "
"select :guilabel:`TBAI` in the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` field."
msgstr ""
"לחץ על :guilabel:`העלה את הקובץ שלך` כדי להעלות את האישור, הזן "
"את :guilabel:`סיסמת האישור` שסופקה על ידי רשות המסים, ובחר :guilabel:`TBAI` "
"בשדה :guilabel:`היקף אישור`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:314
msgid ""
"To test certificates, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and, in the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section, "
"enable :guilabel:`TBAI Test Mode`."
msgstr ""
"כדי לבדוק אישורים, עבור אל :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` ובקטע :guilabel:`Spain Localization`, הפעל את :guilabel:`TBAI Test "
"Mode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:320
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:362
msgid "Use case"
msgstr "מקרה שימוש"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:322
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:364
msgid ""
"Once an invoice is :ref:`created <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"and :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"לאחר :ref:`יצירת <accounting/invoice/creation>` :ref:`ואישור <accounting/"
"invoice/confirmation>` חשבונית, בצע את השלבים הבאים:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:326
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, make sure the :guilabel:`TicketBAI` "
"option is enabled and click :guilabel:`Send`"
msgstr ""
"בחלון :guilabel:`Print & Send`, ודא שהאפשרות :guilabel:`TicketBAI` מופעלת "
"ולחץ על :guilabel:`Send`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:328
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`TicketBAI` invoice tab, the :guilabel:`TicketBAI status` "
"is updated to :guilabel:`Sent`, and the XML file is available in "
"the :guilabel:`TicketBAI Post File` field."
msgstr ""
"בלשונית חשבונית :guilabel:`TicketBAI`, :guilabel:`TicketBAI status` מתעדכן "
"ל-:guilabel:`Sent`, וקובץ ה-XML זמין בשדה :guilabel:`TicketBAI Post File`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:332
msgid "The TBAI **QR code** is displayed on the invoice PDF."
msgstr "**קוד QR** של TBAI מוצג ב-PDF של החשבונית."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:334
msgid "QR code of the TicketBAI on the invoice."
msgstr "קוד QR של TicketBAI על החשבונית."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:340
msgid "FACe"
msgstr "FACe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:343
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:389
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Spain - Facturae EDI` (`l10n_es_edi_facturae`) "
"module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"ודא שהמודול :guilabel:`Spain - Facturae EDI` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_facturae`) :ref:`מותקן <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:346
msgid ""
"`FACe <https://face.gob.es/en>`_ is the e-Invoicing platform used by the "
"public administrations in Spain to send electronic invoices."
msgstr ""
"<https://face.gob.es/en>`FACe`_ היא פלטפורמת החשבוניות האלקטרוניות המשמשת את "
"המינהל הציבורי בספרד לשליחת חשבוניות אלקטרוניות."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:349
msgid "To configure FACe, follow these steps:"
msgstr "כדי להגדיר את FACe, בצע את השלבים הבאים:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:351
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration` "
"or :menuselection:`Invoicing --> Configuration`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Certificates` in the :guilabel:`Spain Facturae EDI` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"עבור אל :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration` "
"או :menuselection:`Invoicing --> Configuration`, "
"ובחר :guilabel:`Certificates` בקטע :guilabel:`Spain Facturae EDI`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:354
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new certificate."
msgstr "לחץ על :guilabel:`חדש` כדי ליצור אישור חדש."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:355
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the certificate, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` provided by the tax agency, and "
"select :guilabel:`Facturae` in the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` field."
msgstr ""
"לחץ על :guilabel:`Upload your file` כדי להעלות את האישור, הזן "
"את :guilabel:`Certificate Password` שסופק על ידי רשות המס, "
"ובחר :guilabel:`Facturae` בשדה :guilabel:`Certificate scope`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:367
msgid ""
"Make sure the customer has a valid VAT number and that their country is set "
"to `Spain`."
msgstr "ודא שללקוח יש מספר מע\"ם תקף ושהמדינה שלו מוגדרת כ-`Spain`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:369
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, make sure the :guilabel:`Factura-e` "
"option is enabled and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"בחלון :guilabel:`Print & Send`, ודא שהאפשרות :guilabel:`Factura-e` מופעלת "
"ולחץ על :guilabel:`Send`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:371
msgid ""
"The generated XML file, available in the **chatter**, must then be sent "
"manually."
msgstr "יש לשלוח את קובץ ה-XML שנוצר, הזמין ב**chatter**, באופן ידני."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:374
msgid "The XML file is **NOT** sent automatically."
msgstr "קובץ ה-XML **לא** נשלח באופן אוטומטי."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:377
msgid ""
"**FACe** XML files can be sent in batch through `the governmental portal "
"<https://www.facturae.gob.es/formato/Paginas/descarga-aplicacion-"
"escritorio.aspx>`_."
msgstr ""
"ניתן לשלוח קבצי XML של **FACe** באצווה דרך `הפורטל הממשלתי <https://"
"www.facturae.gob.es/formato/Paginas/descarga-aplicacion-escritorio.aspx>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:383
msgid "Administrative centers"
msgstr "מרכזים מנהליים"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:385
msgid ""
"For **FACe** to work with **administrative centers**, the invoice *must* "
"include specific data about the centers."
msgstr ""
"כדי ש-**FACe** יעבוד עם **מרכזים מינהליים**, החשבונית *חייבת* לכלול נתונים "
"ספציפיים על המרכזים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:392
msgid ""
"To add **administrative centers**, create a new **contact** for the "
"**partner** company. Select :guilabel:`FACe Center` as the **type**, assign "
"one or more **role(s)** to that contact, and :guilabel:`Save`. The **three** "
"roles usually required are:"
msgstr ""
"כדי להוסיף **מרכזים מינהליים**, צור **איש קשר** חדש עבור חברת ה**שותף**. "
"בחר :guilabel:`FACe Center` כ**סוג**, הקצה **תפקיד(ים)** אחד או יותר לאותו "
"איש קשר, ו:guilabel:`Save`. **שלושת** התפקידים הנדרשים בדרך כלל הם:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:396
msgid "Órgano gestor: :guilabel:`Receptor` (Receiver);"
msgstr "Órgano gestor: :guilabel:`מקבל` (Receiver);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:397
msgid "Unidad tramitadora: :guilabel:`Pagador` (Payer);"
msgstr "Unidad tramitadora: :guilabel:`משלם` (Payer);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:398
msgid "Oficina contable: :guilabel:`Fiscal` (Fiscal)."
msgstr "Oficina contable: :guilabel:`פיסקלי` (Fiscal)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:400
msgid "Administrative center contact form for public entities."
msgstr "טופס איש קשר של מרכז מנהלי עבור ארגונים ציבוריים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:404
msgid ""
"If administrative centers need different :guilabel:`Codes` per role, "
"different centers *must* be created for each role."
msgstr ""
"אם מרכזים מינהליים צריכים :guilabel:`Codes` שונים לכל תפקיד, יש ליצור מרכזים "
"שונים עבור כל תפקיד."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:406
msgid ""
"When an electronic invoice is created with a partner that has "
"**administrative centers**, *all* administrative centers are included in the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"כאשר נוצרת חשבונית אלקטרונית עם שותף שיש לו **מרכזים מינהליים**, *כל* "
"המרכזים המינהליים נכללים בחשבונית."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:408
msgid ""
"A contact can hold multiple roles, or multiple contacts can each have "
"different roles."
msgstr ""
"איש קשר יכול למלא מספר תפקידים, או שמספר אנשי קשר יכולים לקבל תפקידים שונים "
"כל אחד."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:3
msgid "Switzerland"
msgstr "שוויץ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:6
msgid "ISR (In-payment Slip with Reference number)"
msgstr "ISR (תלוש תשלום עם מספר אסמכתא)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ISRs are payment slips used in Switzerland. You can print them directly "
"from Odoo. On the customer invoices, there is a new button called *Print "
"ISR*."
msgstr ""
"תלושי ISR הם תלושי תשלום המשמשים בשווייץ. ניתן להדפיס אותם ישירות מ-Odoo. "
"בחשבוניות לקוח, ישנו כפתור חדש בשם *הדפס ISR*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:16
msgid ""
"The button *Print ISR* only appears there is well a bank account defined on "
"the invoice. You can use CH6309000000250097798 as bank account number and "
"010391391 as CHF ISR reference."
msgstr ""
