#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:5
msgid "Adyen"
msgstr "Adyen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Adyen <https://www.adyen.com/>`_ is a Dutch company that offers several "
"online payment possibilities."
msgstr ""
"`Adyen <https://www.adyen.com/>`_ היא חברה הולנדית המציעה מספר אפשרויות "
"תשלום מקוונות."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:11
msgid ""
"Adyen is more focused on enterprise customers and may require a minimum "
"number of transactions and a minimum processed volume."
msgstr ""
"Adyen ממוקד יותר בלקוחות ארגוניים ועשוי לדרוש מספר מינימלי של עסקאות והיקף "
"מעובד מינימלי."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:17
msgid "Adyen configuration"
msgstr "תצורת Adyen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:19
msgid ""
"Create an Adyen account if necessary and log into your `Adyen Customer Area "
"<https://ca-live.adyen.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"צור חשבון Adyen במידת הצורך והתחבר ל`אזור הלקוח של Adyen <https://ca-"
"live.adyen.com/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:23
msgid ""
"Log into your **Test account** to try the integration without charging "
"customers. Switch to your **Live account** once you are ready to accept "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"התחבר ל**חשבון הבדיקה** שלך כדי לנסות את האינטגרציה מבלי לחייב לקוחות. עבור "
"ל**חשבון החי** שלך לאחר שתהיה מוכן לקבל תשלומים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Contact the Adyen support team <https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/quickstart-"
"guide/support#contact-adyen-support>`_ to enable the **Multiple partial "
"capture** feature."
msgstr ""
"`צור קשר עם צוות התמיכה של Adyen <https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/"
"quickstart-guide/support#contact-adyen-support>`_ כדי להפעיל את התכונה "
"**לכידה חלקית מרובה**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:28
msgid ""
"In the Adyen Customer Area, go to :menuselection:`Developers --> API "
"credentials` and click the relevant API credential user name in the list or "
"click :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new credential` to create a "
"new one."
msgstr ""
"באזור הלקוח של Adyen, עבור אל :menuselection:`Developers --> API "
"credentials` ולחץ על שם משתמש האישורים הרלוונטי ברשימה או לחץ :icon:`fa-plus-"
"circle` :guilabel:`Create new credential` כדי ליצור חדש."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:31
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Server settings` section, click :guilabel:`Generate API "
"key`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy API key`) icon and "
"save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"בקטע :guilabel:`הגדרות שרת`, לחץ על :guilabel:`צור מפתח API`, ולאחר מכן לחץ "
"על הסמל :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`העתק מפתח API`) ושמור את הערך "
"לשלב :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Client settings` section, click :guilabel:`Generate client "
"key`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy client key`) icon and "
"save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"בקטע :guilabel:`Client settings`, לחץ על :guilabel:`Generate client key`, "
"ולאחר מכן לחץ על הסמל :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy client key`) ושמור את "
"הערך לשלב :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:37
msgid ""
"Enter your Odoo database URL in the :guilabel:`Add allowed origins` field, "
"then click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"הזן את כתובת ה-URL של מסד הנתונים של Odoo שלך בשדה :guilabel:`Add allowed "
"origins`, ולאחר מכן לחץ :guilabel:`Add`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:39
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save changes` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr "לחץ על :guilabel:`שמור שינויים` בתחתית הדף."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:40
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developers --> Webhooks` in the left menu and "
"click :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new webhook`."
msgstr ""
"עבור אל :menuselection:`Developers --> Webhooks` בתפריט השמאלי "
"ולחץ :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new webhook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:42
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create new webhook` popup, click :guilabel:`Add` on "
"the :guilabel:`Standard webhook` line."
msgstr ""
"בחלון הקופץ :guilabel:`Create new webhook`, לחץ :guilabel:`Add` "
"בשורה :guilabel:`Standard webhook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:44
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Webhook generation` form, in the :guilabel:`Server "
"configuration` section, enter your Odoo database :guilabel:`URL` followed by "
"`/payment/adyen/notification`."
msgstr ""
"בטופס :guilabel:`יצירת Webhook`, בקטע :guilabel:`תצורת שרת`, הזן "
"את :guilabel:`כתובת URL` של מסד הנתונים של Odoo שלך ואחריה `/payment/adyen/"
"notification`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:46
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Security` section, click :guilabel:`Generate` "
"under :guilabel:`HMAC`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy HMAC "
"to the clipboard`) icon and save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/"
"adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"בקטע :guilabel:`אבטחה`, לחץ על :guilabel:`יצירה` תחת :guilabel:`HMAC`, ולאחר "
"מכן לחץ על הסמל :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`העתק HMAC ללוח`) ושמור את הערך "
"לשלב :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:49
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save configuration` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr "לחץ על :guilabel:`שמור תצורה` בתחתית העמוד."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:50
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developers --> API URLs`, then copy "
"the :guilabel:`Prefix` and save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/"
"adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"עבור אל :menuselection:`Developers --> API URLs`, ולאחר מכן העתק "
"את :guilabel:`Prefix` ושמור את הערך לשלב :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/"
"configure_odoo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:58
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the payment provider Ayden <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`נווט אל ספק התשלום Ayden <payment_providers/supported_providers>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:59
msgid ""
"Fill in the :ref:`Merchant Account <adyen/merchant-account>`, :guilabel:`API "
"Key`, :guilabel:`Client Key`, :guilabel:`HMAC Key`, and :guilabel:`API URL "
"Prefix` fields with the values saved at the :ref:`Adyen configuration step "
"<payment_providers/adyen/configure_dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"מלא את השדות :ref:`Merchant Account <adyen/merchant-"
"account>`, :guilabel:`API Key`, :guilabel:`Client Key`, :guilabel:`HMAC "
"Key`, ו-:guilabel:`API URL Prefix` עם הערכים שנשמרו ב:ref:`שלב תצורת Adyen "
"<payment_providers/adyen/configure_dashboard>`."

