#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:67
msgid ""
"If you want to :ref:`test Adyen without affecting live transactions "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`, use your **Test account** credentials, enter "
"`https://checkout-test.adyen.com` in the :guilabel:`API URL Prefix` field, "
"and set the :guilabel:`State` field to :guilabel:`Test Mode`."
msgstr ""
"אם ברצונך :ref:`לבדוק את Adyen מבלי להשפיע על עסקאות אמיתיות "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`, השתמש באישורי **חשבון הבדיקה** שלך, הזן את "
"`https://checkout-test.adyen.com` בשדה :guilabel:`קידומת URL של API`, והגדר "
"את השדה :guilabel:`מצב` ל-:guilabel:`מצב בדיקה`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:75
msgid ""
"To enable :ref:`manual capture <payment_providers/manual_capture>` for Adyen "
"payments, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"כדי להפעיל :ref:`לכידה ידנית <payment_providers/manual_capture>` עבור תשלומי "
"Adyen, בצע את השלבים הבאים:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:79
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab and enable :guilabel:`Capture Amount "
"Manually`."
msgstr ""
"עבור ללשונית :guilabel:`תצורה` והפעל את :guilabel:`לכוד סכום באופן ידני`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:80
msgid ""
"Log in to your Adyen Customer Area, then go to :menuselection:`Settings` and "
"click :guilabel:`Company` in the :guilabel:`Account management` section."
msgstr ""
"התחבר לאזור הלקוח שלך ב-Adyen, ולאחר מכן עבור אל :menuselection:`Settings` "
"ולחץ על :guilabel:`Company` בקטע :guilabel:`ניהול חשבון`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:82
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`General` section, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Edit property`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Capture Delay` field."
msgstr ""
"בקטע :guilabel:`כללי`, לחץ על הסמל :icon:`fa-pencil` (:guilabel:`ערוך "
"מאפיין`) ליד השדה :guilabel:`עיכוב לכידה`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:84
msgid ""
"In the popup, set the :guilabel:`Capture delay` field to :guilabel:`Manual` "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"בחלון הקופץ, הגדר את השדה :guilabel:`עיכוב לכידה` ל-:guilabel:`ידני` ולחץ "
"על :guilabel:`שמור`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the transaction is not captured within 7 days, the customer is entitled "
"to revoke it."
msgstr "אם העסקה לא נלכדת תוך 7 ימים, הלקוח זכאי לבטל אותה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:89
msgid ""
"You can :ref:`manually capture <payment_providers/manual_capture>` "
"and :ref:`refund <payment_providers/refunds>` payments directly from your "
"Adyen Customer Area."
msgstr ""
"אתה יכול :ref:`ללכוד באופן ידני <payment_providers/manual_capture>` "
"ו:ref:`להחזיר <payment_providers/refunds>` תשלומים ישירות מאזור הלקוח שלך "
"ב-Adyen."

