#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Amazon Payment Services <https://paymentservices.amazon.com/>`_ or APS is "
"an online payment provider established in Dubai offering several online "
"payment options."
msgstr ""
"`Amazon Payment Services <https://paymentservices.amazon.com/>`_ או APS הוא "
"ספק תשלומים מקוון שהוקם בדובאי המציע מספר אפשרויות תשלום מקוונות."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:13
msgid "Configuration on APS Dashboard"
msgstr "תצורה בלוח הבקרה של APS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:15
msgid ""
"Log into your `Amazon Payment Services Dashboard <https://fort.payfort.com/"
">`_ and go to :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Security Settings`. "
"Generate the :guilabel:`Access Code` if none has been generated yet. Copy "
"the values of the :guilabel:`Merchant Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access "
"Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` and :guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase` "
"fields, and save them for later."
msgstr ""
"התחברו ללוח הבקרה שלכם ב-`Amazon Payment Services <https://fort.payfort.com/"
">`_ ועברו אל :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Security Settings`. "
"צרו את ה-:guilabel:`Access Code` אם עדיין לא נוצר. העתיקו את הערכים של "
"השדות :guilabel:`Merchant Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access "
"Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` ו-:guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase`, "
"ושמרו אותם לשימוש מאוחר יותר."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:20
msgid ""
"Enter your Odoo database URL in the :guilabel:`Origin URL`, for example: "
"`https://yourcompany.odoo.com/`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Save Changes`."
msgstr ""
"הזינו את כתובת ה-URL של מסד הנתונים של Odoo שלכם ב-:guilabel:`Origin URL`, "
"לדוגמה: `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/`. לאחר מכן, לחצו על :guilabel:`Save "
"Changes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:22
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Technical Settings` and "
"click on :guilabel:`Redirection`. Make sure :guilabel:`Status` is set to "
"`Active` and select your preferred payment methods underneath "
"in :guilabel:`Payment Options`."
msgstr ""
"נווטו אל :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Technical Settings` ולחצו "
"על :guilabel:`Redirection`. ודאו ש-:guilabel:`Status` מוגדר ל-`Active` ובחרו "
"את שיטות התשלום המועדפות עליכם למטה תחת :guilabel:`Payment Options`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid ""
"Set :guilabel:`Send Response Parameters` to :guilabel:`Yes` and enter your "
"database URL followed by `/payment/aps/return` in the :guilabel:`Redirection "
"URL`."
msgstr ""
"הגדירו את :guilabel:`Send Response Parameters` ל-:guilabel:`Yes` והזינו את "
"כתובת ה-URL של מסד הנתונים שלכם ואחריה `/payment/aps/return` "
"ב-:guilabel:`Redirection URL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid "For example `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/payment/aps/return`."
msgstr "לדוגמה `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/payment/aps/return`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid ""
"Enter your database URL followed by `/payment/aps/webhook` in "
"the :guilabel:`Direct Transaction Feedback` and :guilabel:`Notification URL` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"הזינו את כתובת ה-URL של מסד הנתונים שלכם ואחריה `/payment/aps/webhook` "
"בשדות :guilabel:`Direct Transaction Feedback` ו-:guilabel:`Notification URL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid "For example `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/payment/aps/webhook`."
msgstr "לדוגמה `https://yourcompany.odoo.com/payment/aps/webhook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save Changes`."
msgstr "לחצו על :guilabel:`Save Changes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:32
msgid ""
"Under :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Payment Page Template` you "
"can customize the look and feel of the Amazon Payment Services payment page "
"(where customers fill out their credit card details during payment)."
msgstr ""
"תחת :menuselection:`Integration Settings --> Payment Page Template` תוכלו "
"להתאים אישית את המראה והתחושה של דף התשלום של Amazon Payment Services (שבו "
"לקוחות ממלאים את פרטי כרטיס האשראי שלהם במהלך התשלום)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:41
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the payment provider Amazon Payment Services "
"<payment_providers/add_new>`, change its state to :guilabel:`Enabled`, and "
"make sure it is :guilabel:`Published`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`נווטו אל ספק התשלומים Amazon Payment Services <payment_providers/"
"add_new>`, שנו את מצבו ל-:guilabel:`Enabled`, וודאו "
"שהוא :guilabel:`Published`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:43
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab, fill the :guilabel:`Merchant "
"Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` "
"and :guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase` with the values you saved at the "
"step :ref:`payment_providers/aps/configure-dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"בלשונית :guilabel:`Credentials`, מלא את :guilabel:`Merchant "
"Identifier`, :guilabel:`Access Code`, :guilabel:`SHA Request Phrase` "
"ו-:guilabel:`SHA Response Phrase` עם הערכים ששמרת "
"בשלב :ref:`payment_providers/aps/configure-dashboard`."

