"Copy the :guilabel:`API Login ID` and save it for "
"the :ref:`payment_providers/authorize/odoo-configuration` step."
msgstr ""
"העתק את ה-:guilabel:`מזהה כניסה ל-API` ושמור אותו לשלב ה-"
":ref:`payment_providers/authorize/odoo-configuration`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:22
