"Optionally, select :guilabel:`Enable QR codes` to activate QR code payments."
msgstr ""
"באפשרותך לבחור ב-:guilabel:`הפעל קודי QR` כדי להפעיל תשלומים באמצעות קוד QR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:87
msgid ""
":doc:`Additional accounting setup <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
