"the :ref:`information received from DPO Pay <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"מלא את השדות :guilabel:`מזהה שירות` ו:guilabel:`אסימון חברה` ב:ref:`מידע "
"שהתקבל מ-DPO Pay <payment_providers/dpo/configure_dashboard>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:35
msgid "Configure the remaining options to your liking."
