#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Paymob <https://paymob.com/>`_ is an Egypt-based payment service provider "
"operating in Egypt, Oman, Saudi Arabia, and the United Arab Emirates. It "
"allows businesses to accept online payments through credit and debit cards, "
"as well as several local payment methods."
