#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:27
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Account Info` section, copy the value of "
"the :guilabel:`HMAC` field and save it for :ref:`later <payment_providers/"
"paymob/configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""
