"אותו :ref:`לשימוש מאוחר יותר <payment_providers/paymob/configure_odoo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:29
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`View` next to the :guilabel:`API Key`, :guilabel:`Secret "
