"נווט אל :menuselection:`Developers --> Payment Integrations` בתפריט השמאלי."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:33
msgid ""
"Ensure that all required payment methods are listed in the payment "
"integrations. If any payment method is missing, contact Paymob support."
