#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:54
msgid ""
"For a payment method to be available to customers, it must be activated in "
"Odoo **and** added to the :ref:`list of payment integrations on the Paymob "
"dashboard <payment_providers/paymob/configure_dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"כדי שאמצעי תשלום יהיה זמין ללקוחות, יש להפעיל אותו ב-Odoo **ובנוסף** להוסיף "
"אותו ל:ref:`רשימת אינטגרציות התשלום בלוח הבקרה של Paymob <payment_providers/"
"paymob/configure_dashboard>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/paymob.rst:57
msgid ""
"If a payment method is added to the Paymob dashboard **after** "
"synchronization, click :guilabel:`Synchronize with Paymob` again to make it "
